  "implementation": [
    "Extend the existing SpeechSettings, reader modal, session, tabs and VoiceRegistry PCM assembly; no new engine, worker, transport, storage schema or automatic playback.",
    "Three exact integer millisecond fields, each 0..30000; default zero keeps the old split_utterances route and original engine settings object.",
    "Reuse current deterministic punctuation/newline and blank-line boundaries; explicit form feed marks sections. Co-located section > paragraph > sentence selects one value, including zero. No inferred heading or language/acoustic alignment.",
    "Before engine/output admission, nonzero pacing is bounded to 10000 nonempty utterances and one hour of extra silence. Whitespace normalization scans each run once per bounded boundary iterator.",
    "Count actual sample-rate PCM frames with half-up millisecond rounding, unsigned PCM8 midpoint or signed wider zero, and include extra frames in existing output-byte admission. Existing cancellation and causal output/part retention remain.",
    "The same immutable settings flow through both actual reader Read and Save WAV owner handoffs. Registered Studio and SAPI facade routes continue through the same existing registry.",
    "Generic helper receives the exact old six-field native settings payload. Nonzero recovery fields are optional; all-zero reader records retain exact old canonical bytes. Named voice profiles and available-voice declarations are unchanged.",
    "ReadingAudio validates ordered source offsets and actual frame intervals, holds the prior word during added silence, and retains approximate timing inside spoken segments.",
    "Native and supported flat backup validators already delegate reader records to ReaderDraftStore.decode; no additional validator allowlist or backup authority was introduced.",
    "Current __main__/project console registrations expose no direct SpeechSettings reader CLI; the separate audio.cli Director production and authored pause_after contract remain unchanged."
  ],
  "safety_boundaries_unchanged": [
    "Source-document signatures/selected text/voice identity and both fresh owner-thread settings checks.",
    "Existing output selection, explicit first playback, quiet admission, Stop/Close/Destroy and pending native ownership.",
    "Existing provider timeout, source/runtime fingerprint checks and maximum PCM output bytes.",
    "Existing source/installed selectors, assertions, native 90-second watchdog and 5-second readiness waits."
  ],
